{title: Aahatein}
{artist: Agni}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D]Aahatein, ho [Bm]rahin teri   Dil ke [Em7]dar pe mere
Tu [F#m7]yahin hai kahin na kahin   [D]Aahatein, ho [Bm]rahin teri
Dil ke [Em7]dar pe mere   Tu [F#m7]yahin hai kahin

{c: Chorus}
Kabhi [D]mere khwab sa   Kabhi [Bm]uljhe jawaab sa
Ke chanda [Em7]mein bhi daag sa   Mere jaisa [F#m7]tu

{c: Verse 2}
Ke dariya [D]ka ho ik sira   Ke armaa [Bm]no ka silsila
Ke sehra [Em7]mein bhi aab sa   Mere jaisa [F#m7]tu, mere jaisa tu

{c: Chorus}
[D]Aahatein, ho [Bm]rahin teri   Dil ke [Em7]dar pe mere
Tu [F#7]yahin hai kahin na [D]kahin

{c: Verse 3}
[Am]Tera hoon main,   tujhe kyon na [D]yaqeen hai
[Am]Chaahat mein meri   aakhir kya [D]kami hai

{c: Chorus}
[Am]Tujhme hi toh chhupi   meri [D]khudi hai
[C]Meri [G]khudi kuch na [A]sahi   Kuch [F#m7]na sahi, Kuch na sahi

{c: Verse 4}
[D]Aahatein, ho [Bm]rahin teri   Dil ke [Em7]dar pe mere
Tu [F#7]yahin hai kahin

{c: Verse 5}
Kabhi [D]mere khwab sa   Kabhi [Bm]uljhe jawaab sa
Ke chanda [Em7]mein bhi daag sa   Mere jaisa [F#m7]tu

{c: Verse 6}
Ke tu hi dariya [D]ka hay ik sira   Ke armaa [Bm]no ka silsila
